          "id": "c",
          "text": "$4$"
        },
        {
          "id": "d",
          "text": "$1.5$"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "b",
      "explanation": "Substitute $x_0 = 1$: $x_1 = \\frac{1^2 + 3}{4} = \\frac{4}{4} = 1$."
